{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"The instructor for the course is Prof. Amy Glasmeier.","source_span":"Instructor\nProf. Amy Glasmeier"}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"The course (11.006) was taught in Fall 2016 at the Undergraduate level.","source_span":"11.006 | Fall 2016 | Undergraduate"}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"The course requires three written assignments plus one group assignment; students select 3 assignments from the list but must include Assignment 1, and everyone works together on Assignment 4.","source_span":"This course requires three written assignments and one group assignment, culminating in a written report. Select 3 assignments from the list below. You must include assignment 1, and we will all work together on assignment 4."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"Assignment 1 must be no more than 6 pages double-spaced, and students should not engage or interview a person for it.","source_span":"In not more than 6 pages (double-spaced), present the image or narrative... You should\nnot\nengage or interview a person for this assignment."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"Assignment 2(A) is a data exercise using GIS, 6-8 pages, due Class 8.","source_span":"We will have an in-class tutorial on GIS. Maps, tables, and charts are expected... 6-8 pages.Due Class 8."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"Assignment 2(B) is a policy, sector, or program memorandum, 6-8 pages, due Class 8.","source_span":"A policy, sector or program memorandum focused on issues such as immigration, education, international comparisons on global urban poverty, policy transitions, etc. 6-8 pages... Due Class 8."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"Assignment 2(C) is a 4-6 page essay addressing a question about \"millennials\" and economic security, due Class 8.","source_span":"Write a short (4-6 page) essay in which you frame and address a question about \u201cmillennials\u201d and economic security... Due Class 8."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"Assignment 3 is a 750-1000 word book review, due Class 10.","source_span":"The product will be a 750-1000 word book review... Due Class 10."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"Assignment 4 is a Group Project producing a report on the living wage for health care professionals in Massachusetts, with the final report due at the end of the term.","source_span":"Group Project: Report on the living wage for health care professionals in Massachusetts... The final report is due at the end of the term."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"A short public presentation will be scheduled in lieu of a final exam.","source_span":"A short public presentation will be scheduled in lieu of a final exam."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"The Assignment 4 project supports a professional association that represents 3000+ Community Health Workers in Massachusetts.","source_span":"We will be supporting the director of the professional association that represents 3000+ Community Health Workers in Massachusetts."}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"MassHealth will soon award contracts to newly formed Accountable Care Organizations (ACOs) that will include Community Health Workers in integrated care teams.","source_span":"MassHealth will soon be awarding contracts to newly formed Accountable Care Organizations (ACOs). These ACOs will include Community Health Workers in their integrated care teams"}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","statement":"The Living Wage Calculator used for the project is operated at MIT.","source_span":"Working with the\nLiving Wage Calculator\noperated at MIT, we have developed a procedure to collect and find true local costs of living."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","fact_refs":[0,1],"question":"Who is the instructor of MIT's 11.006 Poverty and Economic Security course, and in what term was it taught?","answer":"Prof. Amy Glasmeier taught the course, offered in Fall 2016 at the undergraduate level."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","fact_refs":[2],"question":"How many written assignments must students select in this course, and which assignment is mandatory for everyone?","answer":"Students must select 3 assignments from the list, but Assignment 1 is mandatory for all, and everyone also works together on Assignment 4."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","fact_refs":[3],"question":"What is the page limit for Assignment 1, and what should students avoid doing when completing it?","answer":"Assignment 1 must be no more than 6 pages, double-spaced, and students should not engage or interview a person for the assignment."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","fact_refs":[4,5,6],"question":"What are the page lengths and due dates for the three Assignment 2 options?","answer":"All three Assignment 2 options are due Class 8: Assignment 2(A), a GIS-based data exercise, and 2(B), a policy memorandum, are each 6-8 pages, while 2(C), an essay on millennials and economic security, is 4-6 pages."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","fact_refs":[7],"question":"What is the required word count and due date for the Assignment 3 book report?","answer":"Assignment 3 is a 750-1000 word book review, due Class 10."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_11-006-poverty-and-economic-security-fal_assignments","fact_refs":[8,9],"question":"What is the topic of the Assignment 4 group project, and what replaces the final exam?","answer":"Assignment 4 is a group project producing a report on the living wage for health care professionals in Massachusetts, due at the end of the term; a short public presentation is scheduled in lieu of a final exam."}
